/k4vB3MO83lyzRbOdNTFk1Zu2ViD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9SZXZvbHV0aW9uYXJ5LUxvdmUtJTI4S29yZWFuLXNlcmllcy0yMDE3JTI5Lw.1.12","title":"Episode 12","season":1,"episode":12,"released":"2017-11-19T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Facing accusations from his brother, Hyuk has three days to prove his innocence. To get a hold of hard evidence, Joon recruits an unlikely spy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dy86UhU9SKz71esPUe5YxCudaHB.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9SZXZvbHV0aW9uYXJ5LUxvdmUtJTI4S29yZWFuLXNlcmllcy0yMDE3JTI5Lw.1.13","title":"Episode 13","season":1,"episode":13,"released":"2017-11-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Joon quits her job to find what she wants to do. Hyuk looks into a company named BS. Woo-sung suspects that Je-hoon has turned.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cB8SjjUrSJQMyxHC5nk37xYRDyn.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9SZXZvbHV0aW9uYXJ5LUxvdmUtJTI4S29yZWFuLXNlcmllcy0yMDE3JTI5Lw.1.14","title":"Episode 14","season":1,"episode":14,"released":"2017-11-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Je-hoon plans a day full of activities from Joon's bucket list. What she doesn't know is that this is his way of saying goodbye.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5A5wNznV7n0wfJOo2wxVhNIEBEW.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9SZXZvbHV0aW9uYXJ5LUxvdmUtJTI4S29yZWFuLXNlcmllcy0yMDE3JTI5Lw.1.15","title":"Episode 15","season":1,"episode":15,"released":"2017-12-02T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Gangsu Group retaliates against corruption charges by firing their employees. But the groundwork's already been laid for a \"byeonhyeok\": a revolution.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fO66VOLoumSIxNUyAQb9fvilUhK.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMTEtMjAyMC9SZXZvbHV0aW9uYXJ5LUxvd